	"data": "Cover Letter Christopher DiCarlo ForwardXP\n\nJuly 30, 2020\nForwardXP Inc \nDallas, TX\nRe: Software Engineer - Enterprise VR\nDear Hiring Manager,\nI am applying for the position of Software Engineer\nI am very interested in this position. I believe I am a solid fit for this work, including experience with Unity, C#, VR, and object-oriented design.\nI have been studying and developing programs with Unity and C# for the last couple of years and have a high degree of knowledge and interest in Oculus VR…",
